notes:
Mapping decisions:
- language_switch per_question: the bilingual Test Booklet prints every question in English and the opted medium side by side (bulletin Ch.4 §6 iii-v).
- interface generic: NEET (UG) is an NTA pen-and-paper OMR test; the schema has no NTA OMR value (schema change requested).
- interface_profile null: the bulletin does not say whether Clear Response keeps a review mark (a required field), so the observed NTA screen details are kept below instead.
- numeric_input left unset: the paper has no numeric-entry questions, and the schema requires a value (schema change requested).
- qualifying left unset: the rule (percentile_of_all_india_merit) depends on category or on the Commission, which the schema cannot express (schema change requested).

Open questions:
- The NEET (UG) 2027 bulletin is not published yet (checked 2026-10-29). This blueprint is the latest official pattern; it must be re-verified and versioned for neet-ug-2027 when NTA notifies it.

